#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provide some hints as to possible moves, should the player become stuck. Cards"
" that can be legally moved to another pile are temporarily highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Fornece algunhas suxestións de xogadas posíbeis, no caso de quedar o xogador a"
"prisionado. As cartas que poidan moverse de forma legal quedan realzada tempor"
"almente."

