#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: index.docbook:858
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "You can change the faces and backs of the playing cards and the game theme. To do so please use <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycap>F10</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Change Appearance...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the menubar."
